    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it’s not just a setback though. it's everything. i've lost the funding, i'm failing the classes, and i just... i look at them and see all that hope they had for me, and it just feels like a lie now. i've wasted years of their lives. i feel like if i just wasn't here, at least they could remember me as someone who actually made it, instead of this mess i've become.",
